      <div type="clause" n="Prol. 3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:XAtr">X Atr</ref> Prol. 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þis is seo gerædnes þe we willað healdan, swa swa we æt Eanham fæste gecwædon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And this is the ordinance which we desire to observe in accordance with what we have firmly decreed at Enham.</ab>
